<div class="row">
  <div class="col-md-6 offset-md-3">
    <div class="alert alert-danger" role="alert">
      <h4 class="alert-heading">Authentication Failed</h4>
      <p>{{message}}</p>
      
      {{#if error}}
      <hr>
      <h5>Error Details:</h5>
      <p><strong>Error:</strong> {{error}}</p>
      {{#if error_description}}
      <p><strong>Description:</strong> {{error_description}}</p>
      {{/if}}
      {{/if}}
      
      <hr>
      <p class="mb-0">Please <a href="/auth/login" class="alert-link">try again</a> or contact support for assistance.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="card mt-4">
      <div class="card-header bg-info text-white">
        <h5 class="mb-0">Debugging Information</h5>
      </div>
      <div class="card-body">
        <p>If you're seeing this error, it might be due to one of the following reasons:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your client credentials (client ID or secret) are incorrect</li>
          <li>The redirect URI is not registered in your Amazon Cognito app client settings</li>
          <li>The requested scopes are not enabled in your Cognito app client</li>
          <li>Your session has expired or was lost</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Check the browser console and server logs for more detailed error information.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div> 